<table style="width:100%">
  <tr>
    <td style="color:#223388; font-size:150%; vertical-align:middle"><span style="color:black; font-weight:600">NIST Atomic Spectra Database Lines Data</span><p>
      <u>Fe I</u>: 10031 Lines of Data Found<br />
<span style="font-size:larger; font-weight:bold"><i>Z</i> = 26, Fe isoelectronic sequence</span><span style="font-size=300%">&nbsp;</span></p>
    </td>
    <td style="text-align:right; vertical-align:middle">
<div class='ref'>
<b>Example of how to reference these results:</b><br />

Kramida,&nbsp;A., Ralchenko,&nbsp;Yu., Reader,&nbsp;J., and NIST ASD Team (2024).
  <i>NIST Atomic Spectra Database</i> (ver.&nbsp;5.12),
  [Online]. Available: <span style="color:#0000cc;">https://physics.nist.gov/asd</span>
  [2025, March 22].
  National Institute of Standards and Technology, Gaithersburg, MD.
    DOI: <span style="color:#0000cc;">https://doi.org/10.18434/T4W30F</span>
<br />
<div style="text-align: right; font-size: x-small">
<a href="javascript:void(0)" onclick="popdef('/cgi-bin/ASD/bibtex.pl?y=2025&amp;m=March&amp;d=22');return true" target="_top">BibTex Citation</a> (new window)
</div>
</div>
    </td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td colspan="2">&nbsp;</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td colspan="2" style="color:#655665; font-family: helvetica,arial; font-size:80%"><b><u><i>&lambda;</i> in</u>: <span style="color:darkred">vacuum</span> <span style="color:navy"></span><br />
<u>Highest relative intensity</u>: 2510000<br />
<span class="hnd">Some data for neutral and singly-charged ions are available in the <a href="/PhysRefData/Handbook/index.html" target="_new">Handbook of Basic Atomic Spectroscopic Data</a></span>
</b></td>
  </tr>
</table>

<p>
<table style="background-color:black; width:75%; border-spacing:1px" >
  <tr>
    <td colspan="3" style="color:white; font-size:10pt; width:70%; background-color:#224477; text-align:center">
      <b>Primary data sources</b>
    </td>
    <td rowspan="4">
    </td>
    <td style="white-space:nowrap; color:white; font-size:10pt; background-color:#446655; text-align:center">
      <table style="border:thin hidden;text-align:center;width:100%">
        <tr>
          <td style="text-align:center; white-space:nowrap">Query NIST Bibliographic Databases for</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td style="text-align:center"><b>Fe  I</b> (new window)</td>
        </tr>
      </table>
    </td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td class='brt1'>
      Energy Levels:
    </td>
    <td class='bcn'>
      &nbsp;<a onmouseover="self.status='Bibliographic Reference for Fe I';return true;" onmouseout="self.status='';return true;" target="_blank" href="javascript:void(0)" onclick="popded('https://physics.nist.gov/cgi-bin/ASBib1/get_ASBib_ref.cgi?db=el&amp;db_id=11631&amp;comment_code=&amp;element=Fe&amp;spectr_charge=1&amp;type=E');return false">Nave et al. 1994</a>&nbsp;
    </td>
    <td class='blf'>
      &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;The wavenumber measurements in Nave et al 1994 were calibrated with respect to Ar&nbsp;II lines measured by <a onmouseover="self.status='Bibliographic Reference for Fe I';return true;" onmouseout="self.status='';return true;" target="_blank" href="javascript:void(0)" onclick="popded('https://physics.nist.gov/cgi-bin/ASBib1/get_ASBib_ref.cgi?db=el&amp;db_id=2634&amp;comment_code=&amp;element=Fe&amp;spectr_charge=1&amp;type=E');return false">Norl&eacute;n&nbsp;1973 </a>, which were re-measured later by <a onmouseover="self.status='Bibliographic Reference for Fe I';return true;" onmouseout="self.status='';return true;" target="_blank" href="javascript:void(0)" onclick="popded('https://physics.nist.gov/cgi-bin/ASBib1/get_ASBib_ref.cgi?db=el&amp;db_id=11520&amp;comment_code=&amp;element=Fe&amp;spectr_charge=1&amp;type=E');return false">Whaling&nbsp;et&nbsp;al.&nbsp;1995 </a> and found to be systematically too small. To account for this calibration error, the original measured wavenumbers and energy level values from Nave et al. 1994 have been increased here by 6.7 parts in 10<sup>8</sup>. The ionization energy is from <a onmouseover="self.status='Bibliographic Reference for Fe I';return true;" onmouseout="self.status='';return true;" target="_blank" href="javascript:void(0)" onclick="popded('https://physics.nist.gov/cgi-bin/ASBib1/get_ASBib_ref.cgi?db=el&amp;db_id=7743&amp;comment_code=&amp;element=Fe&amp;spectr_charge=1&amp;type=E');return false">Schoenfeld&nbsp;et&nbsp;al.&nbsp;1995 </a>, adjusted by the same scaling factor.
    </td>
    <td class='bcn1'>
      <a href="javascript:void(0)" onclick="popbib('https://physics.nist.gov/cgi-bin/ASBib1/Elevbib/make_query.cgi?spectra=Fe%20I&amp;method=EL&amp;method=TE&amp;method=ND&amp;method=IP&amp;method=SF&amp;method=QF&amp;order=1');return false"
        onmouseover="self.status='Fe  I: bibliography energy levels query';return true;"
        onmouseout="self.status=''; return true;" target="_blank">Fe  I Energy Levels</a>
    </td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td class='brt1'>
      Lines:
    </td>
    <td class='bcn'>
      &nbsp;<a onmouseover="self.status='Bibliographic Reference for Fe I';return true;" onmouseout="self.status='';return true;" target="_blank" href="javascript:void(0)" onclick="popded('https://physics.nist.gov/cgi-bin/ASBib1/get_ASBib_ref.cgi?db=el&amp;db_id=11631&amp;comment_code=&amp;element=Fe&amp;spectr_charge=1&amp;type=L');return false">Nave et al. 1994</a>&nbsp;
    </td>
    <td class='blf'>
      &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Observed wavenumbers have been increased by 6.7 parts in 10<sup>8</sup>, similar to the energy levels.
    </td>
    <td class='bcn1'>
      <a href="javascript:void(0)" onclick="popbib('https://physics.nist.gov/cgi-bin/ASBib1/Elevbib/make_query.cgi?spectra=Fe%20I&amp;method=W&amp;method=CL&amp;order=1');return false"
        onmouseover="self.status='Fe  I: bibliography wavelengths query';return true;"
        onmouseout="self.status=''; return true;" target="_blank">Fe  I Line Wavelengths and Classification</a>
    </td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td class='brt1'>
      Transition Probabilities:
    </td>
    <td class='bcn'>
      &nbsp;<a onmouseover="self.status='Bibliographic Reference for Fe I';return true;" onmouseout="self.status='';return true;" target="_blank" href="javascript:void(0)" onclick="popded('https://physics.nist.gov/cgi-bin/ASBib1/get_ASBib_ref.cgi?db=tp&amp;db_id=7958&amp;comment_code=&amp;element=Fe&amp;spectr_charge=1&amp;type=T');return false">Fuhr and Wiese 2006</a>&nbsp;
    </td>
    <td class='blf'>
      
    </td>
    <td class='bcn1'>
      <a href="javascript:void(0)" onclick="popbib('https://physics.nist.gov/cgi-bin/ASBib1/Fvalbib/make_query.cgi?spectra=Fe%20I&amp;order=1');return false"
        onmouseover="self.status='Fe  I: bibliography transition probability query';return true;"
        onmouseout="self.status=''; return true;" target="_blank">Fe  I Transition Probabilities</a>
    </td>
  </tr>
</table>
    <p>
